===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˌkɑt.l.ˈiːd.n/}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|cotyledon|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|κοτυληδών||cup-shaped cavity|tr=kotulēdōn|lang=grc}}, from  {{term|κοτύλη||cup|tr=kotulē|lang=grc}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|botany|lang=en}} The [[leaf]] of the [[embryo]] of a [[seed]]-[[bearing]] [[plant]]; after [[germination]] it becomes the first leaves of the [[seedling]].

